sn0hHNyDTo2McjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfswbEUvcYKUVlkJYt42FS3nZMTBLpLUjZsu_ZzKavQ9sA&oe=69A994BB"}, "display_name": "Motocross Offroad", "keywords": ["motorbike", "motocross", "offroad", "race", "bike"], "long_description": "Physics : \ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f\nDifferent motorbikes with realistic physics without motion sickness. Each motorbike has unique riding experience. \n\nMaps :\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f\u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f\ud83c\udf19\nNavigate rocky canyons, splash through mud pits, and catch air off natural jumps. Feel the rush as you lean into turns, surrounded by towering pine trees and sun-drenched vistas.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1Beat the AI enemies and take the keys of motorbikes! \ud83c\udfc1\n\n", "short_description": "In \u201cMotocross Offroad\u201d riders strap on their virtual reality headsets and become off-road warriors. Picture yourself gripping the handlebars of a rugged dirt bike, the engine growling as you tear through wild landscapes. Whether you\u2019re battling it out in intense races, conquering treacherous trails, or pulling off gravity-defying stunts, this game delivers the full-throttle experience.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "None Play Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "None Play Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RACING", "SIMULATION", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_l